@startuml

!define INITIALIZATION_BEGIN
!define INITIALIZATION_END
!define DATA_PROCESSING_BEGIN
!define DATA_PROCESSING_END

participant DataReader
participant WordCloudConfig
participant WordCloudLibrary

INITIALIZATION_BEGIN
DataReader -> DataReader: 读取二手房数据文件
INITIALIZATION_END

WordCloudConfig -> WordCloudConfig: 配置基础参数
WordCloudConfig -> WordCloudLibrary: 创建WordCloud对象

DATA_PROCESSING_BEGIN
WordCloudLibrary -> WordCloudLibrary: 分词处理
WordCloudLibrary -> WordCloudLibrary: 设置词云格式
WordCloudLibrary -> WordCloudLibrary: 生成词云
WordCloudLibrary -> WordCloudLibrary: 保存词云图
DATA_PROCESSING_END

@enduml
